- AC-020 (FR-020, BR-009): Given A has two tabs and a second device on X, when A types in tab 1, then neither tab 2 
nor the second device shows A as typing.
- AC-021 (FR-021): Given healthy connectivity and A on two devices with 6 unread in X, when A reads only the first 3 
on device 1, then within 5 s device 2 shows 3 unread for X; after reading the rest, 0. Given A is the sender of 
messages read by B, then A's receipt summary/details on both of A's sessions match the stored receipts within 5 s.
- AC-022 (FR-022): Given healthy connectivity and A on two devices, when A sends on device 1, then it appears once on 
device 2 within 5 s without reload.
- AC-023 (FR-023, BR-010): Given A types "@" in a room conversation, then the list shows only room-conversation 
members other than A, filters as A types, and supports arrows/Enter/Tab/Esc and mouse; choosing "Bruno" inserts a 
highlighted mention; a workspace user who never joined the room chat is not listed.
- AC-024 (FR-023, FR-024, BR-010; must-not R1-q16 F): On the real route and local DB: a message mentioning a 
