[use-message-notifications.ts:114](/E:/projects/virtual-office/src/hooks/ui/use-message-notifications.ts:114), 
[desktop-notifications.ts:189](/E:/projects/virtual-office/src/lib/messaging/desktop-notifications.ts:189), 
[notification 
E2E:316](/E:/projects/virtual-office/__tests__/api/playwright/messaging-desktop-notifications.spec.ts:316). **Fix:** 
define browser-wide viewing eligibility before notification claiming. Add visible-plus-hidden tests with the hidden 
tab receiving first, alongside once-across-tabs mention tests.

10. **Medium — BR-004/005; FR-005; AC-008: retrying a key-reuse rejection cannot recover.** `CLIENT_MESSAGE_ID_REUSED` 
